*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0037
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 487
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0037.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FRD0037C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 RVW-IND            PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-CHECK-MINOR
    PERFORM HIGH-RISK-REGION
    DISPLAY "RVW-IND=" RVW-IND
    STOP RUN.
2000-CHECK-MINOR.
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR
    IF CU-CUST-AGE LESS THAN 21
       AND CU-TXN-AMT GREATER THAN 9000
        MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
    END-IF.
HIGH-RISK-REGION.
    IF CU-TXN-AMT GREATER THAN 70000
       AND CU-ORIG-CTRY = 'XA'
        MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
        CALL 'FRDALERT' USING INPUT-AREA
            ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE
        END-CALL
    END-IF.
